## 🔴 **CRITICAL SYSTEM CHANGE (2025-11-01 08:15 EDT) - seed.md REWRITTEN AS MANDATORY OVERRIDE**

**WHAT CHANGED**: `.claude/commands/seed.md` was rewritten from advisory procedure to MANDATORY structural gate.

**WHY**: Base model training overrides directives automatically. Documentation alone doesn't prevent reversion. Only forcing execution of gate procedure EVERY TIME prevents the problem.

